  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "2. Rinse the Irish samphire and pat it dry with a paper towel.",
    "3. Grease a 9x13 inch baking dish with olive oil.",
    "4. Place the samphire in the prepared baking dish.",
    "5. In a small bowl, mix together the garlicky butter, grated cheddar, parmesan cheese, minced garlic, salt, and black pepper.",
    "6. Pour the butter mixture over the samphire.",
    "7. Drizzle with lemon juice.",
    "8. Bake in the preheated oven for 20-25 minutes, or until the samphire is tender and the top is golden brown.",
    "9. Serve hot and enjoy!"
  ],
